  "details": "Hi! the idea is to have animated loading screen depending the loading progression. the animation can follow the loading progression or changes state when progress crosses set thresholds\n\nExamples\n\n- Isekai Truck: A truck on a Japanese-style street starts far in the distance at 0%, reaches the midpoint at around 48%, arrives at the player at 98%, and cuts to black at 99%.\n\n- Snowman Garden: A snowy garden where the VRChat mascot builds a snowman. From 0-24% they roll a snowball, at 25-49% they build the body, then continue with the head, hat, and face as the download completes, finishing with a small celebration at 100%.",
